{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"so I'm helping some friends who have never D&D at all ever, learn... and I'm taking it slow, and since ill be running for them via discord, I'm teaching them a lot of the Roanoke etiquette (how to say, emote, and ooc talk, spoilers for different languages, etc).\n\nbasically, they heard me talk about R3 and are hoping to join next year with a bit of a feel for it all.  So I keep going to the R3 server and using bits of convos i was in to demonstrate stuff\n\nwhich lead to gils funeral.... which lead to one of them wanting the context of what lead to his death.  so i just spent like 15 mins typing out a summary of gils story arc.... and man... it gets real damn dark at the end.\n\nanyway... I love having the r3 server as a resource to teach people how to roleplay online with","created_at":"2020-09-03T16:03:09.113000Z","edited_at":"2020-09-03T16:53:35.353000Z","id":"751110042631274526","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
