{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"I think at some point we should discuss how we handle pronouns for next year. I think our system worked well in general, especially for player characters, but it was always a little weird with DMs. There wasn't much of an issue with that last year as Radar and Noah were the two main DMs, and they and their main npcs both used he/him pronouns. But with the increased amount of DMs I can only imagine it will be difficult to keep track of the pronouns for each of us as well as the pronouns for the characters we play. My current best plan is to have the players do pronouns the same way we did last year, and DMs should have our personal pronouns and just make an effort to make the pronouns of our characters clear. \nI'm also going to post something I've used in another server as a guideline for how to deal with messing up pronouns.","created_at":"2020-09-04T01:01:30.637000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"751245525042593863","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
