{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"Mariam thanks for typing all that up! I def want to make sure DMs and Mods get comfy correcting incorrect pronouns. Aint no thing, we all mess up, but we all should get used to helping call it out. Practice makes perfect! Then if we all have ours marked and are trying our best to use others correctly (when in doubt use the character name or they/them or yall or comrade or whatever other gender neutral word works)  it'll create a safer space for players when they enter the server. Set the tone as it were.","created_at":"2020-09-04T04:39:20.928000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"751300345816416282","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
